      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַם</span></big>  <strong>subst.</strong>[<strong>masc.</strong>] <strong>charco turvo (</strong>aramaico <em>idem</em>, <span dir=\"rtl\">ܐܶܓܡܳܐ</span>, assírio <em>agammu</em> Dl<sup>W</sup><strong>)</strong>—<span dir=\"rtl\">א׳</span> no estado absoluto <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 35:7\" href=\"/Isaiah.35.7\">Is 35:7</a>; estado construto <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">41:18</a> + duas ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אֲגַמִּים</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:1\" href=\"/Exodus.8.1\">Ex 8:1</a> + <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:2\" href=\"/Exodus.8.2\">2</a> ocorrências; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַגְמֵי</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.23\">Is 14:23</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">אַגְמֵיהֶם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:19\" href=\"/Exodus.7.19\">Ex 7:19</a>—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>turvos</em> ou <em>lamacentos</em> (escuros), <em>charcos</em> ou <em>pântanos</em>, no plural <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 14:23\" href=\"/Isaiah.14.23\">Is 14:23</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  qualquer <em>charco, lagoa</em>, no singular <span dir=\"rtl\">א׳ מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 41:18\" href=\"/Isaiah.41.18\">Is 41:18</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 107:35\" href=\"/Psalms.107.35\">ψ 107:35</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 114:8\" href=\"/Psalms.114.8\">114:8</a>; plural sem <span dir=\"rtl\">מַיִם</span> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 7:19\" href=\"/Exodus.7.19\">Ex 7:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 8:1\" href=\"/Exodus.8.1\">8:1</a> (P) <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 42:15\" href=\"/Isaiah.42.15\">Is 42:15</a>.<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>caniço de pântano, junco</em> (= <span dir=\"rtl\">אַגְמוֹן</span>) <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 51:32\" href=\"/Jeremiah.51.32\">Je 51:32</a>.",
